{"text": "Just then a troika drove up with ringing bells, and out of it stepped an official, who at once began to question Aksionov. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Aksionov answered all his questions and even invited him to have tea, but the official went on asking where he had spent the night. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The official also wanted to know whether he had seen the merchant that morning and why he had left the inn before dawn. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I am the police officer of this district, he said, and the merchant with whom you spent last night has been found killed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then the two soldiers with him searched Aksionovs things, and out of a bag the officer drew a knife, crying, Whose knife is this. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There was blood on the knife, and Aksionov, so frightened that he could hardly speak, only stammered, It is not mine. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The house was locked from the inside, so you are the only person who could have done it, the officer said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Aksionov swore that he was innocent, but his voice shook and his face went pale, as if he were guilty. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The soldiers tied his feet, threw him into the cart, and took him to the nearest town, where he was put in prison.", "alignment": {"characters": ["J", "u", "s", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", "n", " ", "a", " ", "t", "r", "o", "i", "k", "a", " ", "d", "r", "o", "v", "e", " ", "u", "p", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "r", "i", "n", "g", "i", "n", "g", " ", "b", "e", "l", "l", "s", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "o", "u", "t", " ", "o", "f", " ", "i", "t", " ", "s", "t", "e", "p", "p", "e", "d", " ", "a", "n", " ", "o", "f", "f", "i", "c", "i", "a", "l", ",", " ", "w", "h", "o", " ", "a", "t", " ", "o", "n", "c", "e", " ", "b", "e", "g", "a", "n", " ", "t", "o", " ", "q", "u", "e", "s", "t", "i", "o", "n", " ", "A", "k", "s", "i", "o", "n", "o", "v", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "